+# Attribution
+
+Netie FreeBuild is a modified distribution of oblien/openship
+(https://github.com/oblien/openship), pinned at commit 3d33f5d31e.
+
+Upstream license: Apache-2.0. LICENSE is included unmodified, with every
+upstream copyright line, and so is any NOTICE file.
+
+- copyright notice that is included in or attached to the work
+- copyright license to reproduce, prepare Derivative Works of,
+- Copyright [yyyy] [name of copyright owner]
+
+Not affiliated with or endorsed by the upstream authors. Upstream names and
+logos belong to their owners.
+
+## Changed in stage 1
+
+- Display name Openship, OpenShip rewritten to FreeBuild in prose docs only.
+- This file and a README banner added.
+
+## Not done yet (stage 2)
+
+- Package names, binaries, identifiers and UI strings are still upstream's.
+- SECURITY, SUPPORT and CONTRIBUTING contacts and URLs still point at upstream.
+- Translated docs, changelogs and third-party notices are untouched.
+- Netie gate wiring: A live label goes through claim_deploy (netie.route report_deploy). Simulated is never reported as live.
+- Must be disabled before any release: cdn.oblien.com and Gellix font references (OpenVault DR-0003 explicitly did not copy them)
